hest) closeup composition on white background.\n2. <CHARACTER> In the center full body view from 3 different angles: straight from front, straight from side, straight from back — all wearing the complete team kit from <Picture 2>, with the team crest on the left chest rendered exactly as <Picture 3> (a monochrome white-fill clenched fist with black outline and separator lines inside a thin white circle, all four fingers and the thumb fully visible, no colors, crisp and legible, no distortion) and the white name JAISAL centered on the upper back of the jersey and clean white football boots.\n3. <CHARACTER> On the right 6 round images (same size 2x3 vertical narrow row) with <CHARACTER>'s highlight details: single eye, lips, single ear (in circle), hair color, detailed skin texture color, and the team crest emblem alone on royal blue, exactly as <Picture 3> (monochrome white-fill clenched fist with black outline lines in a thin white circle, no colors, all fingers and thumb clearly visible, crisp and legible).\n\noverall_soundscape: N/A\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\n",
